 "note": "Lunenburg High School staff, though the filename says unknown: the page prints 'SCHOOL STAFF' (line 12) headed by 'High School Principal', and the 'LHS SCHOOL COUNCIL' below it. Lines 1-11 are the end of the high school narrative (a numbered list of improvements); line 49 is the page number. Lines 45-48 are the LHS School Council (principal, faculty, parents, community and student representatives) -- a governance body, not staff, so ignored. Three columns (x 0.12 / 0.41 / 0.71), names assigned to columns by x position. Single-post headings (High School Principal, Assistant Principal, Administrative Secretary, Attendance Secretary, Computer Coordinator, Director of Athletics, Director of Alternative Education, Nurse) go in role_raw; department headings in grade_or_dept. Line 14 prints 'Sarah Sabatini (Chair' with no closing parenthesis; role recorded as 'Chair'. Suffixes printed after a name (', Media Aide', ', Interim Director', ', R.N.', ', Gr. 9&11') are kept in role_raw."
